+	/* Sparky Stereo OS. stereo_request: what the person's Stereo input filter asks the decoder to pair (bits 0 and 1:
+	 * 0 nothing, 1 what the stream marks, 2 frames in turn; bit 2: the first frame of a pair is the right eye's).
+	 * stereo_mark: the mark of the frames handed on (bits 0 to 7: AVStereo3DType + 1, 0 for none; 8 to 15: its flags;
+	 * 16 and 17: 1 frames in turn paired, 2 two views paired). stereo_mode_tag: Matroska's StereoMode as FFmpeg's
+	 * stream tag, for the two anaglyph values AVStereo3D has no type for (RFC 9559 5.1.4.1.28.3). */
+	volatile long stereo_request;
